ubmarine into an alien ocean where every dive takes you into darker and more dangerous depths. Mine resources in a fully breakable environment, face the terrors lurking in the shadows and make sure you know where the exit is.Please leave a review","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:00:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690931","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3240110-1846018067930311","game_id":"steam-3240110","kind":"announcement","title":"The Subminer Demo dives into Convergence 2026 + Seeking Demo Reviews!","summary":"The Subminer is taking a dive into Convergence 2026Subminers rejoice! We are excited to announce that the Subminer demo is being showcased at Convergence 2026. Watch it live today, October 8th, at 11:00AM PT / 14:00PM ET / 19:00PM BST / 20:00PM CEST.The Stream will be available on Convergence's Twitch and Youtube.The trailer shown at the event will pop up here once the event is finished.If you haven't tried it already the NEW Subminer demo is available to play NOW. Take a dive into Enceladus and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T16:00:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930311","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3240110-1845383656383778","game_id":"steam-3240110","kind":"announcement","title":"The Subminer Demo Arrives TODAY with CN Language Support!","summary":"Hello Intrepid Subminers!Thank you so much for all your fantastic feedback during the playtest, it was amazing to see so many people playing the game and engaging with it. With all the playtest comments collected, we're excited to announce that the Subminer Demo is available to play TODAY with CN Language support!You may have spotted The Subminer in Insider Gaming's 28 Games Later: A Horror Showcase ready for Halloween Month! Super cool to be featured alongside such awesome games.Check our new s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T19:34:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383778","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3240110-1840310314342661","game_id":"steam-3240110","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 Come join The Subminer Playtest for Tiny Teams 2026! 🎉","summary":"Do you yearn for the mines? It’s time to explore the depths of Enceladus as the Subminer is open for playtesting! Head over to The Subminer's steam page and click \"Request Access\" to dive in. This playtest version brings: 📋5 Missions to delve into with replayability(!): Recover equipment, rescue the specialists and investigate the mysterious energy source. The last mission can be played as many times as you wish! 🫡 Meet the Specialists: After rescuing them there are three NPCs to meet, the Signa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T17:15:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342661","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3240110-1838407329257849","game_id":"steam-3240110","kind":"announcement","title":"New Trailer + Sign Up for the Playtest! ˚ · • . ° .🫧","summary":"Hello everyone!As seen in today's Convergence showcase - we have a new trailer! Our first playable preview is coming very soon, and sign-ups for the playtest are open now! Head over to The Subminer's steam page and click \"Request Access\" to be one of the first to get your hands on the playable preview when it drops!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T20:30:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329257849","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3240110-1833334318572355","game_id":"steam-3240110","kind":"announcement","title":"5000 Wishlists!","summary":"Woweee, it's been 3 weeks since we showed the world The Subminer and already 5000 of you lovely people have added the game to your wishlists!We're so honoured to know that so any of you are looking forward to this game, and we're really excitedly working on a demo for you to play. So be sure to stay tuned for news on that! You can stay up to date in our Discord or follow us on Bluesky or X!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-22T17:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318572355","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3240110-1831432155571374","game_id":"steam-3240110","kind":"announcement","title":"Tech Turtles x Yogscast Games Brings You The Subminer - Earth Needs You","summary":"Greetings, everyoneEarth is dying. The global energy crisis has reached an irreversible state of damage. We need your help. The ill-fated Enceladus Project was our last ray of hope until we lost all contact with them. It is time to venture forth underneath the icy crust of Enceladus and brave what dangers the ocean has to offer, for this is your chance to save humanity. Find the resources our race desperately needs, but beware of the secrets and terrors that lurk beneath.Yogscast Games plays a k","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-01T13:30:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcem